316:             # BOCOCIZUMAB_LIPID_AUTO_FULL_REVIEW served the honest absent-state banner --
317:             # "No manuscript has been generated for bococizumab-lipid-review" -- so its
318:             # baseline was 2 sentences and 0 machine. The rebuild produced a projected
319:             # manuscript of 11 machine sentences, and this check called that a REGRESSION
320:             # and rolled the page back to the empty banner.
321:             #
322:             # THE PREDICATE ASSUMED EVERY PAGE ALREADY HAD A MANUSCRIPT. Comparing absolute
323:             # counts is only meaningful when both sides are manuscripts; a page GAINING one
324:             # rises on every absolute measure by construction. The comparison is on the
325:             # RATE, and a page with almost nothing before is reported as a gain rather than
326:             # judged against a baseline that describes an empty tab.
327:             NO_MANUSCRIPT_BEFORE = 6      # sentences; the absent-state banner is 2
328:             gained = before_m["sentences"] < NO_MANUSCRIPT_BEFORE <= m["sentences"]
329:             if gained:
